<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>New COROS delivery options</title>
  <style>
    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
      .letter { width:100% !important; table-layout:fixed !important; }
      .letter-body { padding:32px 22px !important; overflow-wrap:break-word !important; word-wrap:break-word !important; }
      .letter-footer { padding:0 22px 30px !important; overflow-wrap:break-word !important; word-wrap:break-word !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#ffffff; color:#172033; font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;">
  <div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; opacity:0; color:transparent;">
    Upload activities and routes manually, or automate delivery from your other connected services.
  </div>
  <div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="A COROS product update from Dimitrios at Quantified Self">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%; table-layout:fixed; background-color:#ffffff;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
          <table role="presentation" class="letter" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%; max-width:600px; table-layout:fixed;">
            <tr>
              <td class="letter-body" style="padding:44px 42px; font-size:18px; line-height:30px; color:#27334a;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">Hi {{#if first_name}}{{first_name}}{{else}}there{{/if}},</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">Your COROS connection in Quantified Self can now do more.</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">You could already sync activities and routes back to Suunto or Wahoo. Now, from the COROS section of the Sync Grid, you can also send activities to COROS automatically from Garmin, Suunto, or Wahoo, and routes from Suunto—or upload activities and routes manually.</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">These changes are available in Quantified Self v10.11.0.</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>Activities</strong></p>
                <ul style="margin:0 0 24px; padding-left:24px;">
                  <li style="margin:0 0 8px;">Upload a FIT activity file directly to COROS.</li>
                  <li style="margin:0 0 8px;">Automatically send new FIT activities from Garmin, Suunto, or Wahoo.</li>
                  <li style="margin:0 0 8px;">Use <strong>Sync past activities</strong> to send a selected date range already stored in Quantified Self without enabling automatic delivery for future activities.</li>
                </ul>

                <p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>Routes</strong></p>
                <ul style="margin:0 0 24px; padding-left:24px;">
                  <li style="margin:0 0 8px;">Upload a GPX or FIT route directly to COROS.</li>
                  <li style="margin:0 0 8px;">Send saved routes from Quantified Self individually or in bulk.</li>
                  <li style="margin:0 0 8px;">If you use Suunto, automatically send new and updated Suunto routes saved in Quantified Self—or send your existing routes once without enabling future delivery.</li>
                </ul>

                <p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>You remain in control</strong></p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">All automatic delivery options are off by default. Nothing is forwarded until you explicitly enable a direction or start an upload. These tools require Pro and active service connections.</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 28px;"><a href="{{coros_tools_url}}" style="color:#174ea6; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none;">Open your COROS tools →</a></p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 24px;">If you have a question, feature request, or notice anything confusing, simply reply to this email. I read every reply personally.</p>

                <p style="margin:0 0 28px;">Best regards,<br>Dimitrios<br><span style="font-size:16px; color:#5d687c;">Founder, Quantified Self</span><br><a href="https://quantified-self.io" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#5d687c; text-decoration:none;">quantified-self.io</a></p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="letter-footer" style="padding:0 42px 36px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:18px; color:#6b7485;">
                You received this product update because COROS is connected to your Quantified Self account. You can manage email preferences in <a href="{{settings_url}}" style="color:#5d687c;">account settings</a>.
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
